sequenceDiagram
    participant Old as Existing Device
    participant New as New Device
    participant A as Server A
    participant B as Server B
    participant C as Server C

    Note over Old,New: Existing device knows account is active on A, B, and C
    New->>A: Login, register device, upload KeyPackages
    New->>B: Login, register device, upload KeyPackages
    New->>C: Login, register device, upload KeyPackages
    par Rooms on A
        Old->>A: Add new device to every room on A
        A-->>New: Welcomes and ordered room logs for A
    and Rooms on B
        Old->>B: Add new device to every room on B
        B-->>New: Welcomes and ordered room logs for B
    and Rooms on C
        Old->>C: Add new device to every room on C
        C-->>New: Welcomes and ordered room logs for C
    end
    Note over Old,New: No cross-server consensus is needed. Each room is ordered only by its own server.
